<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine central bank offers dlrs at 29 pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine central bank offers dlrs at 29 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank has started offering dollars at 29 pesos after being absent from the market in the morning, dealers said on Monday.</p>
</text>
